@startuml
title class diagram - ServoPoseBridge node

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Monospace

class ServoPoseBridge <<rclpy.node.Node>> {
  +pose_command_topic: str
  +twist_command_topic: str
  +pose_active_topic: str
  +start_servo_service: str
  +planning_frame: str
  +end_effector_frame: str
  +publish_rate_hz: float
  +target_timeout_sec: float
  +halt_command_count: int
  +linear_gain: float
  +angular_gain: float
  +max_linear_velocity_mps: float
  +max_angular_velocity_radps: float
  +latest_target: PoseStamped | None
  +previous_target: PoseStamped | None
  +target_linear_velocity: tuple
  +target_angular_velocity: tuple
  +pose_commands_active: bool
  +servo_started: bool
  -_on_pose_active(message): void
  -_on_pose_command(message): void
  -_update(): void
  -_clear_target_state(): void
  -_publish_halt_commands(): void
  -_update_target_velocity(target, now_sec): void
  -_ensure_servo_started(): bool
  -_on_servo_started(future): void
  -_orientation_error(target, current): tuple
}

class PoseStamped
class TwistStamped
class Bool
class Trigger
class Buffer
class TransformListener

class "helper functions" as Helpers {
  +_normalize_quaternion(q): bool
  +_multiply_quaternions(left, right): Quaternion
  +_inverse_quaternion(q): Quaternion
  +_vector_norm(vector): float
  +_clamp_vector(vector, limit): tuple
  +_filtered_vector(previous, current, alpha): tuple
  +_pose_feedback(error, gain, deadband): tuple
}

ServoPoseBridge --> PoseStamped : subscribes pose target
ServoPoseBridge --> Bool : subscribes active gate
ServoPoseBridge --> TwistStamped : publishes delta twist
ServoPoseBridge --> Trigger : starts Servo service
ServoPoseBridge --> Buffer : current wrist TF
ServoPoseBridge --> TransformListener
ServoPoseBridge --> Helpers : math and filtering

note bottom of ServoPoseBridge
  Converts absolute end-effector pose targets into speed_units twists.
  On inactive or timeout, clears target state and publishes repeated zero twists.
end note

@enduml
